</div>

<h3 dir="ltr" id="we-customer-review-9859" class="we-truncate we-truncate--single-line ember-view we-customer-review__title" data-test-customer-review-title>  ‏Unethical and systematic work and method in the rights of users in Yalla
</h3>

  <blockquote id="ember2627069" class="we-truncate we-truncate--multi-line we-truncate--interactive ember-view we-customer-review__body" data-test-customer-review-body>      

      <p dir=false data-test-bidi>Unethical and systematic work and method in the rights of users in Yalla<br /><br />The unethical and methodical work and approach in the rights of users at Yalla This is considered an infringement or considered dealing with the unethical Yalla administration in cooperation with some users in the exploitation of an irregular way to open many badges in exchange for a mobilization of not more than 200 thousand cones in which 4 badges are opened and this method is  Regular with the approval and cooperation of Yalla management<br /><br />The activity has been stopped before the specified time and this is not permissible legally and we demand the removal of badges from those who used the method irregular so that Yalla administration is legal and if it is not removed, this means an immoral action on our part .. We demand the activity to continue until the specified date or remove the badges that have been opened  In an irregular way through activity and we hope you will cooperate in that<br /><br />The badges that are opened by non-regular activity for specific users are the super star, the millionaire, the biggest winner and a super topic. We hope and we ask that you be removed from everyone or the activity be retrieved as it was until the limited date<br /><br />👎</p>
  


<!----></blockquote>

    <h3 class="we-customer-review__header we-customer-review__header--response">
      <span dir="ltr" id="ember2627072" class="we-truncate we-truncate--single-line ember-view we-customer-review__title" data-test-customer-review-response-title>  Developer Response
</span>

      <span class="we-customer-review__separator">, </span>

      
    </h3>

    <blockquote id="ember2627073" class="we-truncate we-truncate--multi-line we-truncate--interactive ember-view we-customer-review__body" data-test-customer-review-response-body>      

      <p dir=false data-test-bidi>Dear user,<br />Thank you for your feedback and your support for Yalla. About the activity “Saving Date Palm” you mentioned , the probability of winning is random and the number of winnings will vary. While keeping the fairness of the activity, we made some optimizations during the activity. Besides, our activity is also giving back Yalla users’ support. Thanks again for your feedback, we will continue to improve the follow-up activities, if you have more ideas or suggestions, welcome to join our active users group to discuss with us.<br />Thanks,<br />Best Wishes.</p>
  


<!----></blockquote>
</div>
              
</div>
          
    
